00:05:39.454 --> 00:05:43.194
area under Projects, which is a folder space inside the app.

00:05:43.694 --> 00:05:48.274
The same pin works across all your devices once you set it up, and phones that support

00:05:48.274 --> 00:05:50.454
it can add a face or fingerprint unlock.

00:05:51.114 --> 00:05:54.194
Files you upload inside a lockchats stay protected too.

