The updated chat GPT Chrome extension can now read content from multiple open tabs at

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:09.860
once.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:14.840
A browser extension is a small add-on that lives in your browser and gives a site or an

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.140
